From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:05:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bind each system's favorite captures for its card on the
 tabbed home

{system:slides} lists the captures a system card slides through, one path per
line: the system's favorites that have a screenshot (the systems grouped in it
included), else its 12 best-rated games that have one, by rating and name.
Collections, tools, emulators and screenshots have none.

The theme variable "systemslides" says which capture each card shows first and
which ones it leaves out (title screens, menus, duplicates): one game per line,
"+" or "-", the game's own system and its path as the gamelist writes it. "%",
"=", "<", ">" and "$" in a path are escaped, since a theme variable holding them is
read as an expression. The list is made once and made again when a game changes.
